<p>You breathe fire in a frontal cone of radius <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">5, 6, 7, 8, 9.</acronym> Any target caught in the area will take <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Strength 100">195, 252, 295, 330, 361</acronym> fire damage over 3 turns.</p><p>The damage will increase with your Strength and the critical chance is based on your Mental crit rate.</p><p>Each point in fire drake talents also increases your fire resistance by 1%.</p>